{"id":"00302","root":"uni00302_1","name":{"ja":"カテジナ","en":"Catejina"},"title":{"ja":"【呪われし美女】","en":"【Cursed Beauty】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【呪われし美女】 カテジナ","en":"【Cursed Beauty】 Catejina"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-02-29","limited":false,"characterId":148,"profile":{"ja":"生まれつき呪い体質を持つ魔族の女性。その呪いは、彼女と一定の時と場所を同じくした周囲の生き物の命を奪うというもので、それゆえ彼女は一か所に留まらず、魔界を放浪していた。しかし彼女は同時にいかなる種族の異性をも魅了してしまうほどの稀有な美貌を持ち、呪いを知ってなお彼女を欲する男達は絶えず、その噂は魔界だけでなく人間界にまで流れる始末であった。魔界にも居づらくなった彼女は人間界に逃げのびるが、今度は噂を聞いた人間達に追われる日々を送っている。","en":"Catejina is a demon-born woman cursed from birth. Her curse steals the lives of any creature that shares the same time and place with her, forcing her to wander the Demon Realm. Despite this, she possesses a rare beauty that captivates any male of any race, and countless men continue to pursue her even knowing the curse. Rumors of her allure spread beyond the Demon Realm into the Human Realm. Unable to stay in the Demon Realm, she fled to the Human Realm, only to find herself constantly chased by humans who have heard the rumors."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"鶴屋春人","forms":[{"id":"uni00302_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[818,1636],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[111,222],"def":[96,192],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","490009"]},{"id":"uni00302_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1236,2472],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[172,344],"def":[142,284],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","490009","490010"]},{"id":"uni00302_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1654,3310],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[233,462],"def":[188,379],"spd":[70,70],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","490009","490010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメー